{"id":"teatro","lemma":"teatro","pos":"noun","rank":1187,"glosses":["theater (a place or building, consisting of a stage and seating, in which an audience gathers to watch plays, musical performances, public ceremonies, and so on)","theater; drama (drama or performance as a profession or art form)","theater (a region where a particular action takes place; a specific field of action, usually with reference to war)"],"ipa":"/teˈatɾo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"teatros"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/61/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-teatro.wav","formAudio":{"teatros":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-teatros.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Yo estaba en el teatro.","en":"I was at the theater.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77069","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"¿Cómo llego al teatro?","en":"How do I get to the theater?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/427834","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"to arrive, get","l":"llegar"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"¿Vas a ir al teatro esta noche?","en":"Are you going to the theater tonight?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609741","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to go"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"night"}]},{"text":"El teatro está vacío.","en":"The theater is empty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453592","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"vacuum, void"}]},{"text":"Vayamos juntos al teatro.","en":"Let's go to the theater together.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/512881","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"next to","l":"junto"},{"g":"to the"},null]}]}